            "image": "shopify://shop_images/R1.webp",
            "t1": "Fades Dark Spots and Hyperpigmentation",
            "desc": "<p>Niacinamide inhibits the transfer of melanin to skin cells, the biological process responsible for dark spots, post-acne marks, and uneven tone. It works at the cellular level, not just on the surface.</p>",
