          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/R2.webp",
            "t1": "Controls Sebum Without Drying SkiN",
            "desc": "<p>Niacinamide regulates sebaceous gland activity, reducing excess oil at the source. Jojoba Oil simultaneously mimics skin's natural sebum, signalling the skin to stop overproducing oil while keeping it moisturised.</p>",
