            "t1": "Delivers Antioxidant Protection Daily",
            "desc": "<p>Vitamin E neutralises free radicals generated by UV exposure and environmental pollution, the primary drivers of premature ageing, pigmentation, and barrier damage. Every application is an invisible shield against daily skin stress.</p>",
            "title": "50%",
            "title1": "<p>reduction in oxidative stress markers</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_PLceze": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/R4.webp",
            "t1": "Provides Deep, Lasting Hydration",
            "desc": "<p>Jojoba Oil and Aloe Vera Leaf Juice work together as a humectant-emollient pair, drawing moisture in and sealing it within the skin layers. The result is hydration that doesn't evaporate within hours.</p>",
            "title": "34–48%",
            "title1": "<p>increase in skin hydration levels</p>"
          }
        }
